                                   vendored unmodified from
                                   https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack
                                   (commit f4cfa76)
  ugens/eurorack-beads/stmlib/   — stmlib support library subset,
                                   © Emilie Gillet, MIT license,
                                   vendored from the eurorack stmlib
                                   submodule (commit e3bd7c9)
  ugens/sc-plugin-headers/       — SuperCollider plugin headers,
                                   © SuperCollider developers, GPL-2+,
                                   taken from SuperCollider 3.13.0

